1. Definitions
   "Software"  means the Parat programs in bin/ (parat-linux-x86_64, parat-windows-x86_64.exe), in every version
               published in this repository or on its release pages.
   "Owner"     means Himanshu, the copyright holder.
   "You"       means the person or organisation using the Software.
   "Output"    means what the Software prints or writes when you run it: answers, counterexamples, DRAT proofs,
               PAC certificates, circuits written with --pac, and log lines.
   "Open files" means the scripts in verify/, the files in benchmarks/ and results/, README.md, RELEASE_NOTES.md and
               CITATION.cff.

